Subject: [PATCH 14/15] windows.web: Implement IVector<IJsonValue> and IIterable<IJsonValue>
 for JsonArray

Windows.Data.Json.JsonArray implements IVector<IJsonValue> and
IIterable<IJsonValue>; QueryInterface returned E_NOINTERFACE for both.
GDK runtimes read the Xbox Live endpoint document through IVector, so
XUserAddAsync failed before any token request and games such as Forza
Horizon 6 showed "Sign In Required".

Add the vector (GetAt, get_Size, GetView, IndexOf, GetMany and the
mutators), a live IVectorView with IIterable, and an iterator. Views and
iterators keep the array alive and read its current contents.
---
  dlls/windows.web/json_array.c |  580 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
  1 file changed, 571 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

